---
description: Every shipped change is logged in FIXES.md
alwaysApply: true
---
Before finishing any fix, feature, or behavior change: append an entry to
repo-root FIXES.md, newest first, using the format in its header.
In scope: bug fixes, features, behavior/config changes, dependency bumps.
Out of scope: pure refactors, docs-only, formatting.
If FIXES.md conflicts on merge/cherry-pick: keep ALL entries, newest first.
